      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize plain text to an audio byte stream, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary modules from the boto3 library to interact with the Amazon Polly API. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the boto3 library and the use of the polly client. </thinking>\n",
